{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup\/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlesExternalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"matching"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"conditions"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A set of strings that OpenSwiftUI compares against"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the incoming user activity or URL to see if OpenSwiftUI","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can open a new scene instance to handle the external event."}]}],"name":"conditions"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene type that limits the kinds of external events for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which OpenSwiftUI opens a new instance."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When your app receives an external event like a user activity or a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"URL, OpenSwiftUI routes the event to a scene for processing. OpenSwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selects the scene that receives the event according to the following"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rules, which it evaluates in order until it finds a destination scene:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"On platforms that support only a single scene per app, send","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the event to the one open scene.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Find an open scene that indicates it prefers to or can handle the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, if any, and send the event to that scene. You use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View\/handlesExternalEvents(preferring:allowing:)"},{"type":"text","text":" view modifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on a view inside the scene to register this preference."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Find a scene declaration with a ","type":"text"},{"code":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scene modifier containing ","type":"text"},{"code":"conditions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that match the external event.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Create a new instance of the first scene that matches and route the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event there.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Find the first scene declaration that doesn’t have the scene modifier.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Create a new instance of this scene and route the event there.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Make sure that at least one of these rules succeeds in your app for all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events that your app claims to handle. Also, make sure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that the scene that receives an event actually handles it. For example,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be sure that a scene that receives user activities handles them with an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"appropriate ","type":"text"},{"code":"View\/onContinueUserActivity(_:perform:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view modifier.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Don’t confuse the ","type":"text"},{"code":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" scene","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"modifier with the ","type":"text"},{"code":"View\/handlesExternalEvents(preferring:allowing:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"view"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" modifier. You use the scene modifier to help OpenSwiftUI choose a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"new scene to open when no open scene handles an external event,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whereas you use the view modifier to indicate that an open scene can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or prefers to handle certain events.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Matching-an-event","level":3,"text":"Matching an event"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To find a scene type that handles a particular external event, OpenSwiftUI"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"compares a property of the event against the strings that you specify"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"conditions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" set. OpenSwiftUI examines the following event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"properties to perform the comparison:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like when your app handles Handoff, OpenSwiftUI uses the activity’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity\/3238062-targetContentIdentifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property, or if that’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity\/1418086-webpageurl"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property rendered as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/URL\/1779984-absoluteString"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/URL"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like when another process opens a URL that your app handles,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenSwiftUI uses the URL’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/URL\/1779984-absoluteString"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An empty set of strings never matches. Similarly, empty strings never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"match. Conversely, as a special case, the string that contains only an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asterisk (","type":"text"},{"code":"*","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") matches anything. The modifier performs string","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"comparisons that are case and diacritic insensitive.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" scenes ignore this modifier. Instead,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document scenes decide whether to open a new scene to handle an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"external event by comparing the incoming URL or user activity’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity\/1418086-webpageurl"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the document group’s supported types."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"important"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Choosing a window to open","anchor":"Choosing-a-window-to-open"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example shows an app with a photo browser scene","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that displays a collection of photos, and a photo detail scene that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enables closer examination of a particular photo:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["@main","struct MyPhotos: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            PhotosBrowser()","        }","","        WindowGroup(\"Photo\") {","            PhotoDetail()","        }","        .handlesExternalEvents(matching: [\"photoIdentifier=\"])","    }","}"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The app uses the ","type":"text"},{"code":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"second scene to ensure that an external event with an identifier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that contains the string ","type":"text"},{"code":"photoIdentifier=","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" creates a new scene of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the second type. Other events, if not handled by an open scene,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cause the creation of a new browser window instead.","type":"text"}]}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE21handlesExternalEvents8matchingQrShySSG_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI11WindowGroupV","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handlesExternalEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"matching","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"}],"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","role":"symbol","title":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Specifies the external events for which OpenSwiftUI opens a new instance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the modified scene.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup\/handlesexternalevents(matching:)"]}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/WindowGroup/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)":{"title":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup\/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup\/handlesexternalevents(matching:)","abstract":[{"text":"Specifies the external events for which OpenSwiftUI opens a new instance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the modified scene.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlesExternalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"matching"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/WindowGroup":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WindowGroup"}],"title":"WindowGroup","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WindowGroup"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A scene that presents a group of identically structured windows.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"title":"Scene","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","